(text "Sky IR sensor carrier: ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 in two 1x22 sockets, I2C on GPIO8/9 with 4.7k pull-ups,\nGPIO10 drives an IRLZ44N that switches the 47 ohm window heater from the 5 V pin. MLX90614, BME280 and heater on headers (off-board leads).\nUnused DevKit pins are left open on purpose." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bbb1c214-cf45-4402-ad0c-94e438614f23"))
